//! Native YAS byte-stream endpoint.
//!
//! This is the product byte-stream loop. Accepted streams begin with the YAS
//! preface, every payload uses `yas-wire`, and family handlers invoke typed
//! backend APIs rather than translating through a retired packet endpoint.

